WEBVTT

00:09:58.368 --> 00:10:01.549
and this is where we can learn
a lesson for how to do things right.

00:10:01.573 --> 00:10:03.750
So this is the city
coat of arms of Amsterdam.

00:10:03.774 --> 00:10:05.790
Now, if this were a United States city,

00:10:05.814 --> 00:10:08.038
the flag would probably look like this.

00:10:08.062 --> 00:10:09.240
You know, yeah.

00:10:09.264 --> 00:10:10.497
(Laughter)

00:10:10.521 --> 00:10:12.571
But instead, the flag of Amsterdam

00:10:12.595 --> 00:10:14.348
looks like this.

00:10:15.546 --> 00:10:17.965
Rather than plopping
the whole coat of arms

00:10:17.989 --> 00:10:21.160
on a solid background and writing
"Amsterdam" below it,

00:10:21.184 --> 00:10:24.093
they just take the key elements
of the escutcheon, the shield,

00:10:24.117 --> 00:10:27.664
and they turn it into the most
badass city flag in the world.

00:10:27.688 --> 00:10:29.418
(Laughter)

00:10:29.442 --> 00:10:33.624
(Applause)